5px/26px georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px"><span>by Alissa J. Rubin</span></p>=
<p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"=
><span>I got to Iraq a few weeks after the U.S. Army. It was April 2003, ju=
st a couple of days after the statue of the Iraqi dictator Saddam Hussein w=
as pulled down in Baghdad.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px geor=
gia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The early days of the invasion,=
 which toppled a </span><a href=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/CKY6=
vzkMJe2a_X0DcBsR8Q~~/AAAAARA~/CfQMhlhAmbXXBrR0qd6qhOWo8iofptd4w5hcnCQ1BrC2J=
ZXNVcGDPRBhq3tl5T-HRx_W__W0gN49H025byVsmlBAD6zH5aOBBuue-DvgTVvL6zmLlku4A89N=
h3ZvfetkToKmalFJQaMOcLNyvMllOkRBUcZSPwPTNXuj44gBZrXwjKS2p5XkKLs_Mi9v1PlT5Q-=
SnioSnRRT-zCgGr5mJBzz48oafF9CtOnUebSLiAWKZF_ysfLcLRFsnPpFQetdtKq0bJ-aVq7eJY=
